Chapter: BvtDirectUse1998
  cites Uoaix chapter ActiveSkillsState
  cites Uoaix chapter GameSession
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 OUO DirectUse and TestSkillInternal: Hiding (21, AdvRate 2000 500 25) at base 30.0 gains SkillGain on (1000 - 300) *
 factor / 100, factor 100 on a success and 50 on a failure; a watcher 20.0 below a user at value 600 learns at factor
 (600 - 400) * 100 / 1000 = 20.
  bvt-direct-use-1998 : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-direct-use-1998 (unused) = act
    a <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242: the 1998 testSkill scripts take the direct-use path (Anatomy 1, Hiding 21, Tracking 38, Spirit Speak 32); Lockpicking 24 and Healing 17 do not" (as-direct 1 & as-direct 21 & as-direct 38 & as-direct 32 & not (as-direct 24) & not (as-direct 17))
    r <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242: the 1998 testAndLearnSkill scripts check at their ranges: Forensics 100, Inscription, Stealing and Taming 50, others none" (as-learn-range 19 == 100 & as-learn-range 23 == 50 & as-learn-range 33 == 50 & as-learn-range 35 == 50 & as-learn-range 21 == 0)
    passed <- as-test-gain 21 300 100 100
    failed <- as-test-gain 21 300 50 100
    b <- bvt-check ("UOAIX-242 stage 2: a direct use gains SkillGain on (1000 - base) * factor / 100, a failure half a success: " & show passed & " and " & show failed) (passed == s98-gain 21 300 300 100 & failed == s98-gain 21 300 650 100 & passed > failed & failed > 0)
    c <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242 stage 2: a watcher 20.0 below the user's value learns at factor 20, and none at or above it" (gs-watch-factor 600 400 100 == 20 & gs-watch-factor 600 600 100 == 0)
    a + r + b + c
  end
